# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in your own key.
# NEVER put a real key in this file or commit .env — this repo is public.
# PrimeUI license key for PrimeVue 5. Without it, the app shows an
# "Invalid PrimeUI License" notice. Get a key from your PrimeUI account
# (Community or Commercial), then build with this file present as .env.
VITE_PRIMEUI_LICENSE_KEY=
